        {
          "text": "Asikaloni uyoobona akuyoowa, awalo Gaza uyoonyongana loko, awalo Ekroni nkaambo kakuti wasyomononwa. Mwami uyoonyonyooka ku-Gaza, a-Asikaloni uyoobula kukalwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu-Asidodi muyookala bantu bavwelene, alimwi njoomanya kami-kami ka-Filistiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Njoomugwisizya bulowa kumulomo wakwe, amasesemyo aali akati kameno aakwe. Uyoosyaalila Leza wesu, uyooba mbuli mukowa mu-Juda awalo Ekroni uyooba mbuli ba-Jebusi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
