        },
        {
          "text": "Lino njookala aŋanda yangu mbuli mulindizi, nkakasye bantu kwiinda nanka kuboola. Takukooyooba limbi sikupenzya uubalyata, nkaambo lino ndabona ameso aangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.9.8",
