        {
          "text": "Njoolobya inkalaki ku-Efraimu ambizi ku-Jerusalemu. Buta bwalumamba buyoonyonyoonwa, nkabela uyooletela bamasi luumuno, Uyooba abwami muzisi zyoonse kuzwa kulwizi kusikila akulwizi lumbi, akuzwa kumulonga mupati akusikila kumagolelo aanyika.",
          "type": "text",
